    "Use integer effective Speed, public Unburden activation, and the selected Protosynthesis/Quark Drive stat when ordering type-aware attacks.",
    "Keep current-turn Speed control active until its expiry, then remove expired bonuses from the next-turn evaluation; track only justified public duration information.",
    "Compare both teams under the same weather and item effects in draft/preview evaluation; preserve Ability Shield-protected type immunities and resistances.",
    "Retain the existing paired-action search and type-aware damage evaluation; no broad search-weight sweep or seed-based tuning was performed."
